## Task: Review plan-convergence approve gate (backend + UI + tests)

### Context

Charter #690 fixes two defects in the cockpit Approve plan button:
1. **Confusion** - button shown while plan_review_role convergence loop runs.
2. **Gate bypass** - clicking before plan:agreed bypasses plan-convergence entirely.

Three sibling leaves implement the fix:
- **#1182** (qa-engineer): tests in /work/tests/690-tests-plan-convergence-guard.test.sh and /work/ui/app/src/690-tests-plan-convergence.test.ts
- **#1183** (executor): Python backend changes in /work/ui/server/crewboss-api.py
- **#1184** (executor): TypeScript UI changes in /work/ui/app/src/api.ts and /work/ui/app/src/App.tsx

### Review checklist

**Backend guard (/work/ui/server/crewboss-api.py):**
- [ ] Guard in do_command is bypass-proof: plan_review_role + plan:agreed absence evaluated FRESH from org.json and live GitHub issue on every call, NOT from cached state.
- [ ] Guard returns ok: false with msg using the literal em dash character — (U+2014, one codepoint), NOT the three-byte sequence â^@^T. Verify: python3 -c "txt=open('/work/ui/server/crewboss-api.py').read(); assert '— approve blocked' in txt"
- [ ] plan_convergence_active field in build_state() uses the same two-condition logic as the guard (policy.plan_review_role set AND plan:agreed absent).
- [ ] plan_convergence_active is False for non-plan-review items.
- [ ] No new imports needed (CB_TEAM and read_json already defined).

**TypeScript UI (/work/ui/app/src/api.ts and /work/ui/app/src/App.tsx):**
- [ ] plan_convergence_active?: boolean added to the Task type in /work/ui/app/src/api.ts after line 15, following established convention (rework_n #185, git_status #258, blast_radius #265, finale_pr #473).
- [ ] Site 1 (~line 833): both Approve plan and Request changes hidden together when c.plan_convergence_active=true; plan-convergence in progress span shown instead.
- [ ] Site 2 (~line 1294): BOTH Approve plan AND Request changes present in the !task.plan_convergence_active branch. Request changes button NOT dropped (behavioral regression check).
- [ ] No round number displayed anywhere in the UI (no round-counter in API response).
- [ ] TypeScript compiles without errors: cd /work/ui/app && npx tsc --noEmit

**Tests:**
- [ ] Bash tests (scenarios 1-4) in /work/tests/690-tests-plan-convergence-guard.test.sh run successfully.
- [ ] Vitest tests (scenarios 5-6) in /work/ui/app/src/690-tests-plan-convergence.test.ts pass.
- [ ] Scenario 5 asserts BOTH action buttons absent during convergence (not just Approve).
- [ ] Scenario 1 assertion uses the literal em dash — matching the Python guard msg exactly.

